### Part 5: Admin Logout Bug & Localhost Redirect
- **Fix Localhost Redirect Bug**: The issue where logging out redirects you to `localhost` instead of the live site happens because of a security feature in NextAuth. If your Vercel environment variable `NEXTAUTH_URL` is incorrectly set to `http://localhost:3000` (or is missing), NextAuth will refuse to redirect to `mothers-zeta.vercel.app` and will fall back to localhost. **You will need to update `NEXTAUTH_URL` to `https://mothers-zeta.vercel.app` in your Vercel Project Settings.**
- **Fix Redirect Destination**: In `src/app/admin/page.tsx`, the logout button currently asks to redirect to `/account/login`. I will change this to redirect to the Home page (`/`) as you requested.
- **Fix Race Condition**: Logging out on the admin dashboard triggers an `unauthenticated` state which causes a `useEffect` to push the user to `/account/login`. I will add a short-circuit state (`isLoggingOut`) so the user smoothly redirects to the Home page without a visual bug.

